        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-23T01:27:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ReverendPain\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/919ad9/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ReverendPain:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Any idea why it has only 7 decks, but is $10 more than other expansions?&nbsp; Just trying to see if there is stuff included not listed that anyone knows of.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In addition to the 5 heroes and 2 environments, there will definitely be villains: at least the Vengeful 5, which you can see described starting here:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-shattered-timelines/posts/350410\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-shattered-timelines/posts/350410</a></p>\n<p>Also remember that hero decks are larger than villain decks. &nbsp;It's a big box, like the base game.</p>",
